  "is_prerecorded": false,
  "description": "The KSER Autumn Fund Drive continues, and you have another opportunity to show your support for Convergence Zone and for all the programming you love on KSER\n\nIt's a dark autumn evening, and a time to explore the spaces between memories of those we've loved and the dark regions beyond\n\nI've got brand new music from Little H Collective, from a live set he performed at Island Books on Mercer Island in the spring; more regional music for the space between the rain - from Hello Meteor, FCS North, missing scenes, Panabrite, and Somafree Institute\n\nSome fine Berlin School explorations as well by Steve Roach, Brendan Pollard, and Caterina Barbieri",
